---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site, services } from '../data/site';
import { testimonials } from '../data/testimonials';

// Homepage preview — locked to these 3 names
const HOMEPAGE_NAMES = ['Teng Run Run', 'K', 'Ben McDonald'];
const preview = HOMEPAGE_NAMES.map(n => testimonials.find(t => t.name === n)).filter(Boolean);
---

<Layout title={`${site.name} | Relational Coach`} description={site.description}>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-avatar-mobile">
            <img src="/images/headshot-6.jpg" alt="Cynthia — Relational Coach" />
          </div>
          <p class="section-label">Relational Coaching with Cynthia Lim</p>
          <h1>You've Been Showing Up for Everyone. When Did You Last Show Up for Yourself?</h1>
          <p>On the outside, everything looks fine. Good career. Good relationships. And yet — something's missing, and you can't quite name it. Or maybe you're in the middle of a change and feel more stuck than you expected. I work with people who are ready to be honest about that — with me, and with themselves.</p>
          <div class="hero-btns">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Discovery Call</a>
            <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">Learn My Story</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
          <div class="hero-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/headshot-6.jpg" alt="Cynthia — Relational Coach" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" />
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge">
            <div class="hero-badge-icon">
                <img src="/images/pcc-badge.png" alt="ICF PCC" style="width:36px;height:36px;object-fit:contain;" />
              </div>
            <div class="hero-badge-text">
              <strong>ICF PCC Accredited</strong>
              <span>200+ clients coached</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUST BAR -->
  <div class="trust-bar">
    <div class="trust-bar-inner">
      <div class="trust-item">
        <img src="/images/pcc-badge.png" alt="ICF PCC Badge" style="width:44px;height:44px;object-fit:contain;" />
        <div><strong>ICF PCC</strong><span>Accredited</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-divider"></div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <span class="trust-item-icon">👥</span>
        <div><strong>200+</strong><span>Clients Coached</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-divider"></div>
      <div class="trust-item">
        <span class="trust-item-icon">📅</span>
        <div><strong>10+ Years</strong><span>Coaching Since 2015</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT TEASER -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-teaser-inner">
        <div class="about-teaser-img">
          <img src="/images/headshot-4.jpg" alt="Cynthia" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-teaser-text fade-up">
          <p class="section-label">Who Is Cynthia?</p>
          <h2>A Bullsh*t Detector. With a Lot of Heart.</h2>
          <p>I am not going to tell you time will heal. I am not going to hand you a worksheet and call it progress. If you pay me and you need the truth — I will tell you the truth. From what I see, what I sense, and sometimes what you're not yet ready to say out loud yourself.</p>
          <p>My clients call me authentic. What that means is: I'm not pretending. I show up fully — I challenge you when you need it, I hold you when it is heavy. This is a joint partnership. I bring the skills and the sharp eye for what is not being said. You bring the willingness to look at it honestly. The work — and the results — belong to both of us.</p>
          <div class="pillars">
            <div class="pillar"><div class="pillar-icon">🔍</div><div class="pillar-text"><strong>No bullsh*t, ever</strong><span>Honest conversations that actually move you</span></div></div>
            <div class="pillar"><div class="pillar-icon">🤝</div><div class="pillar-text"><strong>A joint partnership</strong><span>I map the conversations and surface the blind spots — you do the work</span></div></div>
            <div class="pillar"><div class="pillar-icon">🔥</div><div class="pillar-text"><strong>Space to sit in it</strong><span>You examine the discomfort — I hold the space while you do</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline">More About Me →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HEART SECTION -->
  <section class="heart-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <div class="heart-inner fade-up">
        <p class="section-label" style="color:var(--accent);text-align:center;">What This Work Actually Is</p>
        <div class="heart-body">
          <p>You might be functioning just fine on the outside. Ticking the boxes. Showing up. But somewhere underneath that — maybe for months, maybe for years — there has been a quiet voice that knows this is not it.</p>
          <p class="heart-pullquote">That voice isn't a problem. It's information.</p>
          <p>You have been so many things to so many people. The reliable one. The capable one. The one who figures it out. And the people who matter most to you — they have not seen the real you in a while. When you reconnect to what's core, it ripples out to all of them.</p>
          <p>I do not take you somewhere new. I help you come back to yourself. This is not gentle work — I will ask you the questions you have been avoiding. You sit in the discomfort. I hold the space while you do.</p>
          <p>You do not need to have hit rock bottom. You just need to be honest enough to admit — quietly, just to yourself — that there's more.</p>
          <p class="heart-closing">That honesty? That's enough to start.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2.5rem;">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Discovery Call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SERVICES PREVIEW -->
  <section class="section bg-card">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header center fade-up">
        <p class="section-label">How I Work</p>
        <h2>Space to Get Sorted. Then to Stretch.</h2>
        <p>I work with people whose lives look fine from the outside — but who know something's missing. People in the middle of a change they didn't ask for. People who've been the reliable one for so long, they've lost the thread back to themselves.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        {services.map(s => (
          <div class={`service-card fade-up${s.featured ? ' featured' : ''}`}>
            {s.featured && s.tagline && <span class="service-badge">{s.tagline}</span>}
            <div class="service-icon">{s.icon}</div>
            <h3>{s.title}</h3>
            <p>{s.desc}</p>
            <ul class="service-features">
              {s.features.slice(0, 4).map(f => <li>{f}</li>)}
            </ul>
            {s.price && <div class="service-price">{s.price} <span>{s.unit}</span></div>}
            <a href={s.ctaHref} class={`btn ${s.featured ? 'btn-primary' : 'btn-green'}`}>{s.cta}</a>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TESTIMONIALS PREVIEW -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header center fade-up">
        <p class="section-label">Client Stories</p>
        <h2>Real People. Real Change.</h2>
        <p>These aren't highlight reels. They're what happens when someone finally has a space to be honest — and decides to do something about it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="testimonials-grid">
        {preview.map(t => (
          <div class="testimonial-card fade-up">
            <p class="testimonial-quote">{t.quote}</p>
            <div class="testimonial-author">
              <div class="testimonial-avatar">{t.avatar}</div>
              <div class="testimonial-author-info">
                <strong>{t.name}</strong>
                <span>{t.role}</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <a href="/testimonials" class="btn btn-outline">Read All Stories →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA BANNER -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">My Hand Is Waiting</p>
      <h2>You Don't Need to Be Ready. Just Show Up.</h2>
      <p class="poem-line">"What's rightfully yours will only be claimed when you embrace your power."</p>
      <p>I have had clients say they almost did not book because they thought they were not 'ready'. You do not need to be ready. You just need to show up — I'll meet you there.</p>
      <div class="cta-btns">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white">Book a Discovery Call</a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:rgba(250,246,240,.3);color:rgba(250,246,240,.9);">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
